  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4402.02 “Automated clearing house (ACH) debit” means a debit in which information and payment(s) are electronically transmitted to the department.\n\nSource. #9377, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10021, eff 11-9-11 (from Saf-C 4402.01); ss by #13038, eff 4-20-20 (formerly Saf-C 4402.01)",
